<main id="main">

<section class="of-hero"><div class="of-hero-bg pxw"><img data-px=".18" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1779912217721-a3cc453ae9d6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&h=1200&q=75" alt="a woman with blonde hair in a black satin outfit" width="1800" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="of-hero-in of-w"><p class="of-ey">The style house &middot; Est. 2026</p><h1><span><i>Dress</i></span><span><i>with</i></span><span><i><em>intent.</em></i></span></h1><p class="of-hero-l">Outfits is an independent guide to putting clothes together, from five-piece capsules to the formulas stylists use every day.</p><a class="of-scroll" href="#intro"><span>Scroll</span><i></i></a></div></section>

<div class="of-mq mq" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>Capsule</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Proportion</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Colour</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Texture</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Occasion</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Silhouette</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Capsule</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Proportion</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Colour</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Texture</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Occasion</span><i>&#10022;</i><span>Silhouette</span><i>&#10022;</i></div></div>

<section class="of-s" id="intro"><div class="of-w of-intro"><p class="of-big rv">Great style is rarely about buying more. It is about <em>knowing what goes with what</em>, and wearing it with conviction.</p><div class="of-stats stg"><div class="rv"><b data-count="5">5</b><span>pieces in a starter capsule</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="30">30</b><span>outfits they can make</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="3">3</b><span>colours to build around</span></div></div></div></section>

<section class="of-s of-dark"><div class="of-w of-lb-h"><div><p class="of-ey">The lookbook</p><h2 class="rv">Five ways to wear it</h2></div><p class="of-hint">Drag &rarr;</p></div><div class="hs of-hs"><figure class="of-look"><div class="of-look-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1794953009432-b9fe2ea4f024?auto=format&fit=crop&w=440&h=600&q=75" alt="a woman in a black hat and black outfit in front of a glass building" width="440" height="600" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption><span>Look 01</span><b>Monochrome</b><em>One colour, head to toe. Texture does the talking.</em></figcaption></figure><figure class="of-look"><div class="of-look-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1794950567214-d7b7e4960e77?auto=format&fit=crop&w=440&h=600&q=75" alt="a woman in a red dress and tights beside a black ladder" width="440" height="600" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption><span>Look 02</span><b>One bold piece</b><em>Let a single colour lead; keep the rest quiet.</em></figcaption></figure><figure class="of-look"><div class="of-look-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580478491436-fd6a937acc9e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=440&h=600&q=75" alt="a woman in a red blazer sitting on stairs" width="440" height="600" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption><span>Look 03</span><b>Sharp tailoring</b><em>A structured blazer turns anything into an outfit.</em></figcaption></figure><figure class="of-look"><div class="of-look-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662532577856-e8ee8b138a8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=440&h=600&q=75" alt="a woman with braided hair in a red outfit against a blue sky" width="440" height="600" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption><span>Look 04</span><b>Colour on colour</b><em>Pair a strong hue with its opposite.</em></figcaption></figure><figure class="of-look"><div class="of-look-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562151270-c7d22ceb586a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=440&h=600&q=75" alt="a woman in a long yellow dress under a blue sky" width="440" height="600" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption><span>Look 05</span><b>Easy volume</b><em>A flowing piece needs nothing but good shoes.</em></figcaption></figure></div></section>

<section class="of-sp"><div class="of-sp-l"><div class="of-sp-img pxw"><img data-px=".08" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603189343302-e603f7add05a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=1200&q=75" alt="a person in a wide-sleeved black jacket in silhouette against a white background" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="of-sp-r"><p class="of-ey rv">The outfit formula</p><h2 class="rv">Four layers to every look</h2><ol class="of-fm"><li class="rv"><span>01</span><b>The base</b><p>Two pieces that fit perfectly: a top and a bottom in quiet colours.</p></li><li class="rv"><span>02</span><b>The layer</b><p>A jacket, knit or shirt worn open. It adds depth and shape.</p></li><li class="rv"><span>03</span><b>The shoe</b><p>It sets the mood: trainers relax, loafers sharpen, boots ground.</p></li><li class="rv"><span>04</span><b>The detail</b><p>One belt, bag, scarf or piece of jewellery. One, not five.</p></li></ol></div></section>

<section class="of-s" id="composer"><div class="of-w"><div class="of-cp-h"><p class="of-ey">Outfit composer</p><h2 class="rv">Tell us the day. We will dress it.</h2></div><div class="of-cp rv"><div class="of-cp-f"><fieldset><legend>Occasion</legend><div class="of-ch" data-k="o"><button type="button" class="on">Office</button><button type="button">Weekend</button><button type="button">Dinner</button><button type="button">Travel</button><button type="button">Event</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Mood</legend><div class="of-ch" data-k="m"><button type="button" class="on">Classic</button><button type="button">Relaxed</button><button type="button">Bold</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Weather</legend><div class="of-ch" data-k="w"><button type="button">Warm</button><button type="button" class="on">Mild</button><button type="button">Cold</button></div></fieldset></div><div class="of-card" id="cp-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div></section>

<section class="of-col"><div class="of-col-i pxw"><img data-px=".08" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1795001197269-e5aba934f59d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&h=1100&q=75" alt="a person in a beige high-collared jacket against a black background" width="1000" height="1100" loading="lazy"></div><div class="of-col-t"><p class="of-ey">The colour room</p><h2 class="rv">Pick a base. See its partners.</h2><div class="of-pal" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Base colour"><label><input type="radio" name="bc" value="0" checked><span style="background:#141210" title="Black"></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="bc" value="1"><span style="background:#1F2A44" title="Navy"></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="bc" value="2"><span style="background:#C8B59A" title="Camel"></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="bc" value="3"><span style="background:#F1ECE3" title="Ivory"></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="bc" value="4"><span style="background:#7C8471" title="Olive"></span></label></div><div id="pc-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section>

<section class="of-s" id="capsule"><div class="of-w of-cap"><div><p class="of-ey">Capsule counter</p><h2 class="rv">Small wardrobe, endless outfits</h2><p>Every piece that works with the others multiplies your options. Move the dials.</p><div class="of-dials"><label>Tops <output id="c1v">3</output><input type="range" id="c1" min="1" max="8" value="3"></label><label>Bottoms <output id="c2v">2</output><input type="range" id="c2" min="1" max="6" value="2"></label><label>Layers <output id="c3v">2</output><input type="range" id="c3" min="0" max="5" value="2"></label><label>Shoes <output id="c4v">2</output><input type="range" id="c4" min="1" max="5" value="2"></label></div></div><div class="of-num"><b id="cap-n">36</b><span>possible outfits</span><p id="cap-t"></p></div></div></section>

<section class="of-quote"><div class="of-w"><blockquote class="rv"><p>&ldquo;Buy less, choose well, and make it <em>last</em>.&rdquo;</p><cite>A principle every capsule is built on</cite></blockquote></div></section>

<section class="of-s"><div class="of-w"><p class="of-ey">The edits</p><div class="of-ed stg"><a class="of-edc rv" href="capsule-wardrobe-guide.html"><div class="of-edc-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1794960819338-41531baa4307?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&h=860&q=75" alt="a woman holding a large bouquet of red roses beside a red telephone box" width="700" height="860" loading="lazy"></div><span>Edit 01</span><b>The Capsule Wardrobe</b><em>Build a small, hard-working wardrobe in three colours.</em></a><a class="of-edc rv" href="outfit-formulas-guide.html"><div class="of-edc-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1794950570124-44f4f3b9caaf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&h=860&q=75" alt="a woman with curly hair holding a telephone receiver beside a payphone" width="700" height="860" loading="lazy"></div><span>Edit 02</span><b>Outfit Formulas</b><em>Ten combinations that never fail, for every occasion.</em></a></div></div></section>

